SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 AoE: M3 Fellowship\, February 2027 cohort: AI securi
 ty fellowship for senior security professionals (USD 3\,000 to 4\,000 a mo
 nth\, part-time)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 20 Dec 2026 at 23:59 AoE.\n\nA part-time fellowship that
  moves experienced security people onto projects that reduce risks from ad
 vanced AI. It starts with an in-person week in London\, where projects are
  scoped and red-teamed by peers and field experts\, then continues as a re
 mote build phase alongside your job\, with a weekly accountability call an
 d a demo day in front of organisations and funders.\n\nOrganisation: M3 Fe
 llowship (run with the AI Security Bootcamp)\nLocation: One in-person week
  in London\, UK\, then remote.\nAward: USD 3\,000 to 4\,000 for each month
  of the build phase\, set by experience\, for up to three months at 10 hou
 rs a week. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: One week in London\, t
 hen up to three funded months\, part-time.\n\nMore: https://m3fellowship.c
 om/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://m3fellowship.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
LOCATION:One in-person week in London\, UK\, then remote.
END:VEVENT
